      "sources": [
        "Lebor Gabála Érenn Part IV (Macalister ¶313-317, ¶335-344, pp. 121-197)"
      ],
      "notes": "Elada fathered Eochu Ollathair (The Great Dagda, reigned 80 yrs -> Óengus Mac Óc, poetess-goddess Brigit, and Cermait -> joint kings Mac Cuill, Mac Cécht, Mac Gréine), Ogma (inventor of Ogham -> Delbaeth -> Fiachna -> Ériu [Ireland!], Banba & Fódla, plus the 3 Gods of Danann: Brian, Iuchar, Iucharba), and Bres (half-Fomorian king)!",
